From 79e61dfb88c433d2025011887e91da6025fca769 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: stability - path validation, shared exclusions, safe
 auto-fix, working AI provider selection

- exit 2 on missing/non-directory scan path (was a silent pass)
- project-relative exclusions shared by all scanners; ignore .sentinel_backups
- report unparsable files in errors
- ASTSafeFixer: no template overwrite; placeholder fixes need manual review
- AI: select OpenAI/Gemini from env; fix Gemini endpoint; configurable models
- lazy package exports; console-encoding safe output
- tests/test_stability.py
